OL,3,GNEWSAHot weather delays park
OL,4,Amaintenance projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FPark volunteers are still working on
OL,7,Fsummer maintenance and improvement
OL,8,Fprojects, after their efforts were put
OL,9,Fon hold because of the extreme heat.
OL,11,FIn September, provisional data from the
OL,12,FMet Office showed summer 2026 was the
OL,13,FUK's hottest on record - spring and
OL,14,Fsummer saw persistent heat with five
OL,15,Fwidespread heatwaves and 40 days of
OL,16,Ftemperatures above 30C (86F).
OL,18,FTelford Town Park had to hold up
OL,19,Fprojects including plans to revamp the
OL,20,Fsensory garden, and improvements around
OL,21,Fthe Glade, the North Bank, Grange Pool
OL,22,Fand The Crannog.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
