OL,3,GNEWSAHot weather delays park
OL,4,Amaintenance projects
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's very frustrating, the ground
OL,7,Fbeing hard we couldn't do any digging,"
OL,8,Fsaid Adrian Smith from the Friends of
OL,9,FTelford Town Park.
